    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="56">
        <head>Ine Rb 56</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="56" corresp="#wit-e"><pb n="24" ed="#liebermann"/>C. Be<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="3" target="#Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.oe.3"/> gehwelces ceapes angelde.<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="14" target="#Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.oe.14"/></ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="56" corresp="#wit-g-prol"><pb n="24" ed="#liebermann"/>C. Be gehwylces ceapes angilde.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="56" corresp="#wit-h"><pb n="25" ed="#liebermann"/>C. Be gehwylces ceapes ongilde.<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="2" target="#Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.oe.2"/></ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="56" corresp="#wit-q"><pb n="25" ed="#liebermann"/>De<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="24" target="#Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.oe.24"/> qualicumque<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="25" target="#Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.oe.25"/> captali persoluendo.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" corresp="#wit-e"><pb n="212" ed="#jurasinski-and-oliver"/>C Be gehwelces ceapes angelde</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" corresp="#wit-b"><pb n="212" ed="#jurasinski-and-oliver"/>Be gehwylces ceapes wyrðe</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann"><pb n="25" ed="#liebermann"/>Vom<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="1" target="#Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.de.1"/> Ersatz<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="2" target="#Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.de.2"/> irgend eines Stückes Vieh.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Of compensation for any head of livestock.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" corresp="#wit-e"><pb n="213" ed="#jurasinski-and-oliver"/>Concerning the single-restitution for certain purchases</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" corresp="#wit-b"><pb n="213" ed="#jurasinski-and-oliver"/>Concerning the worth of certain purchases</ab>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.oe.3" n="3" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">24</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">diese Rb. fehlt Ld</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">this rubric lacking in Ld</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.oe.14" n="14" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">24</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">angyld <hi rend="italic">So</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">angyld So</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.oe.24" n="24" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">25</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">Et de <hi rend="italic">T</hi>; Si inveniatur infirmitas in captali persoluto vel vendito <hi rend="italic">Hk</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">Et de T; Si inveniatur infirmitas in captali persoluto vel vendito Hk</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.oe.25" n="25" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">25</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">qua c. <hi rend="italic">T</hi>; animali infirmo vendito <hi rend="italic">Br</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">qua c. T; animali infirmo vendito Br</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.oe.2" n="2" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">25</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">o <hi rend="italic">geänd. in</hi> a</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">o altered to a</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="erklaerung" xml:id="Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.de.1" n="1" source="#liebermann-erkl"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">3</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">42</biblScope><biblScope unit="column">1</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">Q spät. Rez. vervollständigt die Rb aus seinem Text</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">The later recension of Q completes the Rb from its own text</seg><note type="remark" resp="#claude">On several rubrics: Ine Rb 40. 43f. 46—50. 54. 56f. 58. 61f. 67. 70f.</note></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="erklaerung" xml:id="Rubrics-Ine_56.lnote.de.2" n="2" source="#liebermann-erkl"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">3</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">42</biblScope><biblScope unit="column">2</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">Die Rb trifft nicht den Sinn des Textes (Rücknahme verkauften Viehs, weil fehlbehaftet), sondern denkt weiter an den Ersatz des gekauften Viehs: ‘Wert’ B, ‘Bezahlung’ Q</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">The Rb misses the sense of the text (the taking back of livestock that has been sold, because it is defective), but continues to think of the replacement of livestock bought: ‘value’ B, ‘payment’ Q</seg></note>
      </div>
    </body>
